<title>NEW ZEALAND: THL sees yr profit around NZ$6 mln.</title>
<headline>THL sees yr profit around NZ$6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tourism Holdings Ltd said on Friday it  anticipated the group's profit after tax for the year ended June 30  would be about NZ$6 million.</p>
</text>
